architecture representation-manifold
  canonical_name Representation Manifold
  family storage
  domain Bonfyre
  layer substrate
  semantic_question Which physical forms of one semantic subject are useful, and how can each derived form be rebuilt from its exact input frontier?
  purpose Select and realize useful physical representations on demand without multiplying semantic truth or retaining reconstructable bytes by default.
  maturity architectural
